# Scratch probes written by review/verification agents at runtime. They are not
# gates: unwired to npm and CI, and not part of the delivered suite. Ignored
# because `git add -A` swept one into a docs commit whose message never
# mentioned it — the third time an agent's in-flight files landed in an
# unrelated commit this session.
app/test-*.mjs
